AgenticSystemCore Contributor Agreement, version CA-v1

This is the agreement that the token `CA-v1` names in the sign-off trailer every
accepted contribution to this project carries (AGSC-08-06):

    Signed-off-by: Your Name <you@example.org> (CA-v1)

and, where the contribution was made with the help of a model (AGSC-08-07):

    Assisted-by: <producer>/<version> (operator: human:<id>)

It is the Developer Certificate of Origin 1.1, unchanged, and three further clauses
of this project's own. The DCO is reproduced verbatim as its own document, as its
terms require; clauses (e), (g) and (h) below sit beside it and are not a
modification of it. Certifying `CA-v1` certifies (a) to (d) of the DCO and (e), (g)
and (h) of this file.

